# Resource: scaleway_mailbox

Creates and manages a [Scaleway Mailbox](https://www.scaleway.com/en/developers/api/mailbox/) mailbox.

A **mailbox** is a hosted email address (`local_part@domain`) that belongs to a
`scaleway_mailbox_domain`. Prefer `password_wo` so the password is never stored in state.

~> **Note** This resource is in **alpha** and the API is subject to change.

